$D05C Pattern15

$D074 w SampleTable 8 ; 32 samples: their offsets from this table
> Read by TableEntry $C278 for a $80-$9F command.
@res music/disco.bin

$D0B4 b SampleData 15 ; The samples (sample 0 first): rows of 3 bytes (flags and noise, tone delta, mixer and volume)
> Read by SampleStep $C308. Samples 0, 11, 12 and 14-31 are one row with S, L and X: a steady tone at volume 15 that loops on itself until a release ($7E), then ends. The streams use samples 1-10 and 13.
@res music/disco.bin
$D0B7 Sample1
$D102 Sample2
$D132 Sample3
$D156 Sample4
