$D2C4 Sample9
$D315 Sample10
$D369 Sample11 ; samples 11 and 12: one row each
$D36F Sample13
$D4B9 Sample14 ; samples 14-31: one row each

$D4EF w OrnamentTable 8 ; 32 ornaments: their offsets from this table
> Read by TableEntry $C278 for an $A0-$BF command (through CommandOrnament $C26B).
@res music/disco.bin

$D52F b OrnamentData 16 ; The ornaments (ornament 0 first): rows of 2 bytes (flags and noise, note delta)
> Read by OrnamentStep $C385. Ornaments 0, 2, 10 and 11-31 are one row of no change; the streams use 1-10 and 13.
@res music/disco.bin
$D531 Ornament1
