$D593 b SectorTail 16 ; 109 bytes after the module to the end of the 22nd sector: older stream bytes, not read
> Leftovers of the memory the compilation was saved from (they read like a pattern stream: $F0 $0C, notes, $7E, $FF, $85 $A5 $CF $D0 $F0 $01 ...). Known only from the code: the player's pointers end at $D592 and no instruction in c1-c4 reads these bytes.
@res spare/music-tail.bin
